  "steps": [
    "Cook the rice ahead with a little less water, spread it out and cool fully so the grains stay separate.",
    "Heat a wok until smoking, add the oil, then the garlic, ginger and spring onion whites for 20 seconds.",
    "Add the carrot and beans and stir-fry on high heat for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the capsicum and cabbage and toss for another minute so they stay crunchy.",
    "Add the rice with the soy sauce, vinegar, pepper and salt and toss on high heat for 2 minutes.",
    "Finish with the spring onion greens and serve at once."
  ]
